    <description>TranscribeGeek turns recordings into text on your own machine, using Whisper models that run
locally. Nothing is uploaded, so an interview, a meeting or a medical recording never leaves the
computer.

* Transcribe audio and video files, queued in a batch
* Choose the Whisper model to match the machine - the download size is shown before you commit
* Output plain text or timed SRT subtitles
* Work out who is speaking and label each line Speaker 1, Speaker 2 and so on
* Works with no internet connection once a model has been downloaded
* No account, no adverts, no bundled offers, no per-minute charge

Open source under GPL-3.0. The .NET 8 runtime is bundled, so there is nothing to install first.</description>
    <summary>Free offline speech-to-text for Windows - transcribe audio and video on your own machine</summary>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/techygeekshome/TranscribeGeek/releases/tag/v1.1.2</releaseNotes>
